# local material, never game content: the ozi_ns mission pack source and the maintainer's install of it
# (anchored to the repo root: on Windows git matches ignore rules case-insensitively, and an unanchored
# OZI_NS/ silently ignored every NEW file under "DC - Council wars/ozi_ns/" - found 21 Sep 2026)
/OZI_NS/
DC Mission Pack by ozi_ns/

# minimap caches the game regenerates on load (.OVH stays tracked, 1997-build cache the CD data carries)
*.o16
*.O16

# copies the patcher writes for a 640x480 build (the exe is pointed at them; the stock files stay untouched)
DC - Council wars/GAMESTAT/HSCNDC.TXT
DC - Council wars/GAMESTAT/GSCNDC.TXT
DC - Council wars/exp/intrface/bintoze
DC - Council wars/ozi_ns/intrface/bintoze
DC - Council wars/dc/intrface/bintoze
DC - Council wars/exp/intrface/lopme
DC - Council wars/ozi_ns/intrface/lopme
DC - Council wars/dc/intrface/lopme
DC - Council wars/INTRFACE/ONLINE
DC - Council wars/INTRFACE/ONLINEBG.GIF

# the deprecated patched Classic build (1 Oct 2026): no longer shipped - the patcher writes it on request (tick it in the window,
# -IncludeDeprecated, or -Original "DC - Council wars\dc16.exe"); a locally built copy stays out of the repository
DC - Council wars/Dark Colony.exe

# since 2 Oct 2026 every resolution's interface set lives in its own folder HD_<height>P (UW_ for the ultra-wide sizes;
# doc 10.61): the repository ships the 1024x768 set (HD_0768P) and the patcher's inputs (HD_SRC); every other size's
# folder is a patcher output, as is the pre-October INTRF_HD layout left behind in a working copy (the next patcher run
# deletes it)
/DC - Council wars/HD_[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]P/
!/DC - Council wars/HD_0768P/
/DC - Council wars/UW_[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]P/
/DC - Council wars/exp/HD_[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]P/
!/DC - Council wars/exp/HD_0768P/
/DC - Council wars/exp/UW_[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]P/
/DC - Council wars/dc/HD_[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]P/
!/DC - Council wars/dc/HD_0768P/
/DC - Council wars/dc/UW_[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]P/
/DC - Council wars/ozi_ns/HD_[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]P/
!/DC - Council wars/ozi_ns/HD_0768P/
/DC - Council wars/ozi_ns/UW_[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]P/
/DC - Council wars/INTRF_HD/
/DC - Council wars/exp/intrf_hd/
/DC - Council wars/dc/intrf_hd/
/DC - Council wars/ozi_ns/intrf_hd/
